# SpaghettiLAB Community licensing

SpaghettiLAB Community is a multi-license repository. There is no single licence
that applies to every file. The licence closest to a file controls that file.

| Content | Licence |
|---|---|
| `hardware/` | CERN-OHL-S-2.0 |
| `firmware/` | GPL-3.0-or-later |
| `software/` | AGPL-3.0-or-later, except where a nearer licence says otherwise |
| `contracts/` and designated integration SDKs | Apache-2.0 |
| `docs/` | CC-BY-4.0 |
| Root project metadata, unless marked otherwise | Apache-2.0 |

The complete licence texts and the authoritative path-by-path map are provided
in the relevant directories and in [LICENSES.md](LICENSES.md).

The licences above allow commercial use of the material published in this
repository, subject to their respective conditions. They do not grant rights to
the SpaghettiLAB name, logo, visual identity, official-product status, or any
non-public commercial manufacturing package. See [TRADEMARK.md](TRADEMARK.md)
and [COMMERCIAL.md](COMMERCIAL.md).

No permission beyond the applicable open licence is required to use the public
sources within its terms. A separate written agreement is required only for
rights or assets not granted or supplied here, including official brand use and
access to the non-public Production package.
